  "interpretation": "<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p>Detected: Pathogen DNA present; indicates active infection. Clinical management and partner testing are advised.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Not Detected: No DNA of the specific pathogen found. Does not fully rule out infection in presence of ongoing symptoms-consider window periods and sampling site.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Co-infections: Multiple pathogens may be detected in a single sample. Each requires appropriate clinical management.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Limitations: Test specificity and sensitivity are high, but rare false positives/negatives can occur. Results must be interpreted with clinical findings and exposure history.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
